DESCRIPTION:Come join us at Gamers' Haunt for Nexus Nights every Wednesday at 6pm!<br><p>Riftbound takes the familiar setup of many other popular card games and turns it on its head. You don’t fight to damage your opponent\, but to control territory. It’s a faithful translation of the lane-based MOBA (multiplayer online battle arena) League of Legends. Take command of your Champion and utilize the unique Rune resource system to strategize and defeat your opponent.</p><p>The format is 1v1 Constructed\, and we encourage both new players and experts to come try their hand and have fun. Every part [trimmed]
