DESCRIPTION:Join us for our weekly Sorcery: Contested Realm play every Sunday at 2pm! This old-school TCG is a love letter to the Magic of yesterday\, right down to the hand-painted fantasy elements and familiar artist names. In Sorcery\, you are an Avatar\, casting powerful elemental spells\, summoning minions\, finding ancient relics and shaping the Realm. Outmaneuver your opponent in your chosen element\, by land\, sea\, and air before ultimately putting them to Death's Door and claiming victory.<p>We play three rounds starting at 2pm\, but players are encouraged to come early to play casua [trimmed]
